---
title: "C10 — Field resolution and value validation · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Scopes[Workspace to space to folder to list] --> Merge[Nearest key replaces whole definition]
  Merge --> Schema[Resolved schema with provenance]
  Patch[Create, update or move values] --> Apply[Apply patch semantics]
  Schema --> Apply
  Apply --> Omitted[Omitted key preserves value]
  Apply --> Null[Explicit null clears value]
  Omitted --> Check[Validate final complete value map]
  Null --> Check
  Check --> Valid{Types, options, required values and keys valid?}
  Valid -->|Yes| Save[Continue transaction]
  Valid -->|No| Error[400 with field paths]
  Note[Zero and false are real values] -. invariant .-> Check
